            "id": "47352218-ad3c-35f2-a203-6a1b167c6bdd",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Michael Saylor weighs in on buying Strategy stock vs bitcoin ETFs",
            "description": "<p>When looking to enter the crypto space, should investors be buying Strategy stock (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSTR\">MSTR</a>) or bitcoin ETFs, such as the iShares Bitcoin Trust ETF (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/IBIT\">IBIT</a>)?</p>\n<p>Strategy co-founder and executive chairman Michael Saylor sits down with Yahoo Finance senior reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/alexandra-canal/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Allie Canal</a> to answer audience questions, discussing the best method he sees to gain exposure to bitcoin (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BTC-USD\">BTC-USD</a>) and weighing the risks.</p>\n<p>Check out Yahoo Finance's <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/crypto-investors-shouldnt-lose-faith-145215650.html\">full interview</a> with the Strategy executive chairman.</p>\n<p>For full interviews, highlights, and key insights, check out more from\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/topic/yf-invest/\">Yahoo Finance Invest</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "When looking to enter the crypto space, should investors be buying Strategy stock (MSTR) or bitcoin ETFs, such as the iShares Bitcoin Trust ETF (IBIT)? Strategy co-founder and executive chairman Michael Saylor sits down with Yahoo Finance senior reporter Allie Canal to answer audience questions, discussing the best method he sees to gain exposure to bitcoin (BTC-USD) and weighing the risks. Check out Yahoo Finance's full interview with the Strategy executive chairman. For full interviews, highlights, and key insights, check out more from&nbsp;Yahoo Finance Invest.",
